// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Genevieve Sanders 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P325463053" "Genevieve Sanders"
// ProfessionString :
"P3922556531" "Pharmacist"
// DescriptionString :
"P810370422" "During the war, when much of the city was torn to pieces and refugees fled for the countryside, Genevieve stayed. She opened up her pharmacy to freely distribute medicine to the sick and wounded. When her supplies ran out, Genevieve worked in the streets, offering aid and comfort to those who badly needed it. As the city rebuilt she stayed with it, continuing to lend a helping hand. Genevieve has recently started reaching out to the city's heroes, providing them not only with medicine, but also with information about the evil deeds she witnesses every day. She has become a valuable resource in the fight to save Paragon City."
// HelloString :
"P2207821883" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Can you spare a moment for a good cause?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2843382971" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to serve the city?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2805752629" "I'm sorry, I've got nothing for you. Check with {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2360091934" "Nice to meet you, hero."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2044348968" "I don't need any help right now, but I'm sure some of your other contacts do."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2025472174" "I can't give you more work right now. You should finish some of the tasks you already have!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3360808315" "Please come see me when you reach Security Level {Level}. I've got a project I'd like you to look into."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2752377849" "You are a kind and true friend. The doors of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>pharmacy</a> are always open to you. Don't hesitate to call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4193986031" "I think it's time I gave you my full trust. There are some rather <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>scarce pharmaceuticals</a> I'd like you to take a look at."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1534117120" "I know there are others out there who need your help more than I do."
// LocationString :
"P1937455418" "Kings Row"
// IntroString :
"P1380119761" "You should introduce yourself to Genevieve Sanders. She's a pharmacist with a heart of gold who does a lot of community work, and she loves to help heroes against the Hellions and the Circle of Thorns. Genevieve is near the hospital in Kings Row."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P835904214" "Choose Genevieve Sanders"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1312801283" "She is one of the nicest people I know."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1639753300" "I want you to meet <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A>."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2368117288" "There are several <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> who have helped me since the Rikti War. Perhaps one of them can help you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


