// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Juan_Jimenez 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Juan Jimenez 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P902762979" "Juan Jimenez"
// ProfessionString :
"P2255829371" "Photographer"
// DescriptionString :
"P2306840311" "Juan Jimenez was born and raised in Paragon City, and he loves his hometown. He's made his way as a photographer since high school, when he sold Lifetimes Magazine a picture of the Statesman saving his school. Two months after his college graduation, the Rikti invaded. Juan enlisted in the army to help fight the invaders, bringing his camera along, and he managed to snap some of the most memorable photos of the war. Today, he is a freelance photographer who sells his pictures to local and national press outlets. He's also putting together a book of photos chronicling the post-war transformation of the city and its effects on residents' daily lives. As interesting as this is, he knows that it's action shots that pay the bills, so he spends much of his time trying to get images of villains and heroes duking it out. He's currently working with reporter Maggie Greene on an expose about the Skulls."
// HelloString :
"P3798363810" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You ready for some excitement?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2392713726" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got some trouble spots you might want to hear about.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2690748514" "Hey, I'm right in the middle of something. You should catch up with {LastContactName}, ok?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P717248828" "I can help you get where you need to go, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3583476395" "I don't have any more leads for you. Why not ask your other contacts?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1995004905" "No more assignments for you, {HeroName}! Not until you finish some of your current jobs."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3304057153" "My sources want this job handled by someone with Security Level {Level} or higher. Maybe we should talk later."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1510630996" "I am really starting to like you, my friend. Cast your eyes on my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest Enhancements</a>; they're pretty sweet. You hear a rumor, call me, day or night."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P62818812" "You know, {HeroName}, you have really earned my respect with your actions. A source tipped me off to some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>crazy new gear</a>; thought you'd like the first shot at it."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P340837496" "I think I have all the pics I need of you, {HeroName}. Thanks!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2903159603" "Juan Jimenez is a great photographer, and he's always got his ear to the ground. You should talk to him and see if he's following any big stories on the Skulls. Juan is currently covering a story in Kings Row."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P368350155" "Choose Juan Jimenez"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2238912224" "Juan is always eager to help, and he knows where the action is."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3440215463" "You should meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</A> of mine."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P610357262" "I know a couple people who have been asking about you. Must be the flattering pictures I've been taking."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


