// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kip Cantorum 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2214665040" "Kip Cantorum"
// ProfessionString :
"P2318110253" "Electrical Engineer"
// DescriptionString :
"P1747752471" "Kip Cantorum has a reputation as one of the more inventive engineers in Paragon City. He loves to tinker, and he has recently made quite a name for himself by converting technology seized from villains into harmless children's toys. He works closely with many of the city's heroes, who often give him recovered items in exchange for tips about what's going on in the city's technical community."
// HelloString :
"P2445367276" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hi! Ready to stop some bad guys?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P533408011" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Have I got a mission for you!</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1467756462" "Sorry, but I'm swamped. Maybe {LastContactName} has a minute to chat."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3495980217" "What can I do for ya?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3075605022" "If you're looking for work, you'll have to ask one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P956377523" "Whoa, {HeroName}! Better clean out some of that backlog before you go looking for more jobs."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2103352386" "I'd like to give you a job, {HeroName}, but not until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3809371933" "You are my kind of hero, friend. I've got some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new gadgets</a> you should check out. You need something, just call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1191319870" "I think it's time for me to trust you all the way. You should be equipped with all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest tech.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1604269146" "Time for you to find a new fix-it man, my friend."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P943117330" "There's an engineer named Kip Cantorum who knows a lot about illegal technology. You should go see him; he might have some good leads for you on the Vahzilok zombies. Kip's business is in Atlas Park."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1194180599" "Choose Kip Cantorum"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2591743962" "Kip should be able to help you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P781969597" "There's <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> I want you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P179943822" "I have a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> who might be able to help you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


