// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Laurence_Mansfield 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Laurence Mansfield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P197415239" "Laurence Mansfield"
// ProfessionString :
"P2431047860" "Coroner"
// DescriptionString :
"P2233347363" "The coroner's job in Paragon City is complicated by a number of factors: the exotic powers that can cause death, the alien anatomies that complicate autopsies, and the mutant abilities that sometimes make it hard to tell if a person's actually dead. Laurence Mansfield has handled all of these with aplomb for more than twenty years. Not only is he calm, dignified, and insightful, he's also immensely curious. He's a bit of an amateur detective, a hobby the police department frowns on. So Laurence goes straight to some of the city's heroes instead. He's always excited to share tips and theories with costume-clad defenders, and he considers many of them his friends. The police look the other way, in deference to the skill and speed with which he performs his assigned duties."
// HelloString :
"P216410514" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Time flies, hero. We've got work to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3270324141" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've dug up something you'll want to hear.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2967840678" "The bodies are piling up; I don't have time just now. But I bet {LastContactName} would be happy to hear from you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2089269018" "You are livelier than most people I meet."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3205108083" "I've got no more cases you can help with. Look up some of your other contacts instead."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1470575530" "Easy, now, {HeroName}. I'd say you already have a full caseload."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3138551241" "I've got something juicy, but you'll have to wait until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2537634424" "I have actually noticed a drop in the death rate lately, friend. Let's root around in my office. There's always <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>something useful</a> in there. Oh, and could you call me occasionally? It's nice to talk to a living person for a change."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3228368881" "All right, it's time for me to let you in on all my gory secrets. I want you to check out the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>shiny new tools</a> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P928837145" "Time for you to look into some other plots."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1297447344" "You should consider introducing yourself to Laurence Mansfield. He is one of the more personable county coroners. He can be a very helpful resource on the Hellions and the Circle of Thorns. He is located in Atlas Park."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P860856722" "Choose Laurence Mansfield"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4134078767" "Mansfield has a strange sense of humor sometimes."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1355383895" "For a change I have <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone alive</A> to introduce to you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1750314" "I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>couple live ones</A> to recommend to you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


