// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Linda Summers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2388465549" "Linda Summers"
// ProfessionString :
"P2558379567" "Reporter"
// DescriptionString :
"P4190012046" "Linda Summers is a freelance reporter looking to make a name for herself. She earned some notoriety when she landed an exclusive interview with Vahzilok himself, although she had to be saved by a group of heroes when the zombie master decided he wasn't pleased with her interviewing tactics. She doesn't scare easily, and so she perseveres. These days she's thrown herself into the local gang scene and has written a series of compelling articles about life in gangs. Like any good reporter, she always protects her sources, a fact that has earned her the trust of the people she covers. She will work with heroes, although she has been known to keep important facts from them."
// HelloString :
"P2611379592" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I think I have something that will interest you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3167265721" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You'll like this, {HeroName}.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3084505459" "Sorry, but I've got to file a story tonight. If you're looking for a tip, talk to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1563214427" "I have plenty of information at my fingertips. Play it straight with me and I'll do the same."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P68924328" "The news is pretty slow around here lately. Try one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1357871456" "You need to finish some of the work you've already started."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2867546285" "I have a lead, but it's really sensitive. Check back when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3533163153" "You've got a nose for news, my friend. A source just dropped some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</a> in my lap.  You have my cell number, right? So call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1914393808" "I appreciate you dealing with me straight, {HeroName}. I think I have some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> you could use."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1104733655" "Sorry, you need to find a new news outlet."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P347298887" "There's a young reporter named Linda Summers who you might enjoy chatting with. She's always pursuing some crime related story, especially stories dealing with the Skulls. Linda's latest scoop has her in Kings Row."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3016551688" "Choose Linda Summers"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3701921051" "Linda responds well to directness and fair treatment."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4280493871" "I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>source</A> who wants to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1939336037" "I have a couple new ideas for possible <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


