// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Maurice_Feldon 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Maurice Feldon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P251847876" "Maurice Feldon"
// ProfessionString :
"P4114029389" "Inventor's Assistant"
// DescriptionString :
"P450008821" "Maurice Feldon is one of Paragon Polytechnic Institute's most notable recent graduates. His thesis won the National Inventor's Prize in mechanical engineering, but his reputation is hardly that of a shy scientist. Instead, he's known around town as a bit of a loose cannon and a ladies' man. Maurice turned down a number of lucrative research jobs to work as an assistant to Dr. Ann-Marie Engles. He is helping her on a top-secret project, which many speculate must have something to do with his much-loved field of robotics. Despite his devotion to his research, Maurice likes to get out of the lab when he can. Among his many hobbies he includes a bit of amateur sleuthing, and he especially likes to dig into science- and technology-based villainy. He's had a few run-ins with the police, which makes him less than eager to work with the law. Luckily, he has no qualms about passing on his information to heroes, especially if they return the favor."
// HelloString :
"P385459967" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I think I might have something for you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1646050466" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You want a hot tip?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2285523415" "Sorry, I don't know anything about that. {LastContactName} usually has the latest word, though."
// FirstVisitString :
"P794156026" "I hear you are the kind of hero who can get things done. If that's true, we are going to get along fine."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4087734021" "I don't have any more tasks that would interest you. Why not talk to your other contacts?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1552319620" "Don't bite off more than you can chew, {HeroName}. Finish some of the jobs you've already got."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1042310115" "I have something, but it's classified Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2547387454" "I am starting to take a liking to you, friend. Science has made a lot of breakthroughs that could help heroes like you. Why not check out <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>the results</a> in my store? I am at your disposal; call me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3104883872" "You definitely get my full seal of approval, {HeroName}. Please examine the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</a> in my store; I think you'll be surprised at how far technology has come in just a short time."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P335978956" "I think it's time for me to start spending a bit more time in the lab with Dr. Engles. It's been fun, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3111635" "You should talk to Maurice Feldon some time. He keeps track of anything that's going on in the science world. He's particularly interested in the Clockwork King. Maurice's company is in Atlas Park so you can usually find him there."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2895886389" "Choose Maurice Feldon"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2436459183" "Maurice may be a little reckless, but he is very intelligent and he means well."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P515484758" "I know the perfect <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>person</A> to introduce you to!"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1944264624" "I put in a good word for you with a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>couple people</A> I know. You don't have to thank me."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


