// Name :
"P2786223495" "Paco Sanchez"
// ProfessionString :
"P1114556105" "Emergency Medical Technician"
// DescriptionString :
"P4135697854" "Paco Sanchez is an emergency medical technician and a bit of an adrenalin junkie. Part of him yearns for the life of a costume-clad hero, fighting crime with fists and super powers, but he is utterly committed to his job, and he takes pride in saving lives every day.  Still, he's eager to help those who do have super powers, and he's proven himself a valuable contact. He sees a great deal, and he's constantly asking questions of his friends on the police force and in the medical community. When he gets interesting answers, he's happy to pass along what he has learned."
// HelloString :
"P1920507616" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Move fast, hero. There's work to be done.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1224182881" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Things to do, lives to save. Let's get on it.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3907757203" "Sorry, I'm on call, no time to chat. You need a job? {LastContactName} can help you out."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1178535936" "Let's try and prevent some injuries."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2786298010" "If you want some work, you'll have to ask one of your other contacts. I'm fresh out of jobs."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P643234781" "You've got to finish some of those tasks before you go looking for more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P425357596" "I can't give this job to anyone at your current Security Level. Come back when you hit Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1235940530" "You have prevented a lot of people from getting hurt, friend. I've got the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>latest medicines</a> right here in my store; just tell me where it hurts. Call on me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3328653266" "The kind of dedication you have deserves my full trust. Need <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>bandages, meds, Enhancements?</a> I'm your man."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1189242084" "You need to be dealing with bigger problems from now on."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1416866462" "There's an EMT named Paco Sanchez who'd like to meet you. He's not only great at his job, but he also works well with heroes, tipping them off whenever he sees something interesting going on with the Hellions and the Circle of Thorns. Paco can be found in Atlas Park."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1605954558" "Choose Paco Sanchez"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P345317452" "Paco primarily cares about saving lives."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1494847112" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who you can help."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1034747023" "There are a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> of mine who could use your assistance."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


