// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Paula_Dempsey 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Paula Dempsey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3335381242" "Paula Dempsey"
// ProfessionString :
"P2107824002" "Mechanic and Inventor"
// DescriptionString :
"P760602157" "Paula Dempsey moved to Paragon City as a child, when her parents were killed by an invading space armada in the late 60's. She grew up with her grandfather, a famous mechanic who did a lot more than just fix cars. Paula's grandfather maintained the fabulous weapons and equipment used by a hero named Gauge Steele, and Paula grew up hearing stories of their adventures. With a role model like that, there was never any question as to where her career path lay. Today, she not only fixes things, she invents them. She's got a wealth of contacts and has been an excellent resource for new heroes for over a decade."
// HelloString :
"P1461021804" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There's adventure ahead, if you're up for it.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P767361316" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's keep the legacy alive.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3316641279" "Can't you see I'm busy here? {LastContactName} might be able to make time for you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3329551695" "You look like a likely candidate. Let's see if you measure up."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P477629237" "I'm afraid I don't have any more leads for you. You should speak to one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1556713548" "You can't become one of the great ones by taking on more work than you can handle."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3908865088" "I'd like to give you a job, but we'll have to wait until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P731778830" "You definitely got my attention, sport. Let's be friends. I was rummaging around the shop yesterday and I came across some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>interesting Enhancements.</a> I'd be happy if you could use them. If there's any help I can provide you, please call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4074429244" "Gauge Steele woulda been proud of you. You've earned every inch of my trust, {HeroName}. Steele left behind <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>some tokens</a> I'd like you have."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3498699876" "I gotta turn my eye to some of the younger heroes, sport. It's been a pleasure though."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3610581823" "Have you ever met Paula Dempsey? She's a real pistol and has a great deal of information on the Clockwork. You'll like her, and I'll bet she'll like you as well. Paula hangs out in Kings Row."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2112199008" "Choose Paula Dempsey"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P612220440" "Paula has high standards, but I have no doubt you will live up to them, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4147452853" "I want you to meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>buddy</A> of mine."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1509664826" "I think there are a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>couple folks</A> you should meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


