// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Samuel_Pierce 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Samuel Pierce 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1841818445" "Samuel Pierce"
// ProfessionString :
"P1746251691" "Event Promoter"
// DescriptionString :
"P2959643800" "Samuel Pierce earned a citywide reputation when he staged a series of benefit concerts and parties to aid those who lost their homes in the Rikti Invasion. Ever since then he has devoted his time to promoting entertainment events that are fun, stylish, and socially conscious. He's moved on from fundraisers to more pointed political and social statements, using his clout as a promoter to help fight poverty, racism and injustice. Of course, not everyone who attends his parties, raves, and concerts understands his message. Most just want to have a good time. As a result of his social and political activism, Samuel is a well-connected man who sees a lot. He's always happy to pass that information on to heroes he can trust."
// HelloString :
"P1872234989" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let me get you connected.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1716663943" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There are definitely some events that need you on the guest list.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4245752379" "Sorry, I'm all booked up. If you're looking for action, check with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1650055195" "I hope you can do something to stop these party crashers, the Vahzilok. They aren't helping the neighborhood at all."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P491510280" "I haven't seen any party crashers in a while. You should help one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2448288273" "I'm glad you want to help, but you already have too much work."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4025545214" "Sorry, {HeroName}, but this next job is pretty exclusive. Come see me when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2935130225" "You get a special invitation for the work you've been doing so far, my friend. Right now I'm serving up a number of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new Enhancements</a> in my store. Take my private number; you'll want to keep in touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P852537076" "You just moved to the top of the VIP list, {HeroName}. That means you get a chance at the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>best Enhancements</a> in my store."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2064330457" "Time for some new blood, {HeroName}. It's the way of the world. The party world, that is."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1790711633" "You ever been to one of Samuel Pierce's parties? He's an event promoter, and he knows how to put on a good time. He also has a nose for trouble. You should meet him, see if he'll give you a tip on the Vahzilok. Mr. Pierce is promoting a new movie over in Kings Row."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P676050244" "Choose Samuel Pierce"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3859140792" "Samuel is somewhat cavalier, but he wants the city cleaned up very badly."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P803185806" "I have a special <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>introduction</A> for you, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3973747672" "A couple of my close <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> want to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


