// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Tony_Kord 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Tony Kord 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2924552034" "Tony Kord"
// ProfessionString :
"P347810849" "Defense Systems Entrepreneur"
// DescriptionString :
"P509813160" "Tony Kord moved to Paragon City after the Rikti War. A competent engineer and a brilliant businessman, he hopes to make a name for himself as a purveyor of high tech defense systems for heroes and police. His team of talented researchers is hard at work building newer, better weapons designed for use against particular criminal groups. The right tool for the job, he's fond of saying. He often works with new heroes, providing them tips in exchange for help testing his equipment. Right now he's focusing on relatively minor threats like the Clockwork King, but he hopes to expand his business tremendously in the next few years."
// HelloString :
"P1378239826" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ah, {HeroName}, always the right tool for the job.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P831340339" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Thanks for the offer. I sure could use some help.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1645121271" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Are you ready to do some business?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P624126117" "Not sure I am ready to do business with you. You should speak to {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P33640660" "Let's do business!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3951527240" "I've got no more business for you. You should ask one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1430807828" "Looks like you've already got all the business as you can handle."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3463561251" "I've got a job that might interest you, but we'll have to wait until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3797107952" "You show a lot of promise, my friend. I wish Paragon City had more heroes like you. My researchers have just churned out some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new gadgets.</a> I'd like you to be the first to benefit. You run into trouble, just call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1615515641" "You are doing an excellent job. I think I can trust you with some more difficult assignments. You'll need to be <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>fully geared up</a> before you tackle these cases."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2149401899" "There are new wonders out there for you to discover."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3767625204" "Tony Kord is a good person to know. He knows what's happening in the city, especially where the Clockwork are concerned, and he'll often suggest solutions. Tony's company is in Atlas Park, so he usually hangs out there."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3243351574" "Choose Tony Kord"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1466261249" "Deal honestly with Tony if you want his help."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2504298885" "I know a couple <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> who might be able to help you out."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


